    "‘rādhākṛṣṇa’ bal bal bala re sabāi",
    "(ei) śikṣā diyā,    saba nadīyā,",
    "phir‌che nece gaura[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]nitāi",
    "(miche) māyāra baśe’    yāccha bhese’,",
