   "translations": [
    {
     "language_code": "eng",
     "text": [
      "“Everyone, chant, chant, chant the holy names of Rādhā-Kṛṣṇa!” Śrī Gaurāṅga Mahāprabhu and Nityānanda Prabhu are dancing throughout Navadvīpa, giving this instruction to all. “O brothers, you are caught up in the whirlpool of illusory māyā, and are desperately struggling to remain afloat."
     ]
    }
